    "detailed_description": "What if you could edit a platformer level while playing it? Wobbl is a mix of precision and puzzle platformers, in which you make use of different types of edit wands to complete the level.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Edit Wands</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919770/extras/7d5e505dd2c18fe203c26cf2e550ab15.poster.avif?t=1647211650\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919770/extras/7d5e505dd2c18fe203c26cf2e550ab15.webm?t=1647211650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919770/extras/7d5e505dd2c18fe203c26cf2e550ab15.mp4?t=1647211650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Wobbl is filled with familiar edit wands like the Delete wand, Duplicate wand, Move wand, and more. Use these wands to your advantage to complete levels.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Levels</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919770/extras/1d8e42879a0737def9438932e6081765.poster.avif?t=1647211650\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919770/extras/1d8e42879a0737def9438932e6081765.webm?t=1647211650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919770/extras/1d8e42879a0737def9438932e6081765.mp4?t=1647211650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Complete a colourful selection of beautiful pixel art levels, each one filled with unique mechanics, fun puzzles and challenging platforming sections.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Level Is Your Playground</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919770/extras/a2579b6da644b4596ddfc1d855d704d1.poster.avif?t=1647211650\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919770/extras/a2579b6da644b4596ddfc1d855d704d1.webm?t=1647211650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919770/extras/a2579b6da644b4596ddfc1d855d704d1.mp4?t=1647211650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>No problem has only one solution. Use the wands given to you creatively to carve your path through the level or just mess around with objects and enemies - No matter how you use them, these tools will redefine your expectations.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Free Demo</h2><br>A free demo is now available! Play through the first zone of the game right now!! do it!!!",
    "about_the_game": "What if you could edit a platformer level while playing it? Wobbl is a mix of precision and puzzle platformers, in which you make use of different types of edit wands to complete the level.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Edit Wands</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919770/extras/7d5e505dd2c18fe203c26cf2e550ab15.poster.avif?t=1647211650\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919770/extras/7d5e505dd2c18fe203c26cf2e550ab15.webm?t=1647211650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919770/extras/7d5e505dd2c18fe203c26cf2e550ab15.mp4?t=1647211650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Wobbl is filled with familiar edit wands like the Delete wand, Duplicate wand, Move wand, and more. Use these wands to your advantage to complete levels.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Levels</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919770/extras/1d8e42879a0737def9438932e6081765.poster.avif?t=1647211650\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919770/extras/1d8e42879a0737def9438932e6081765.webm?t=1647211650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919770/extras/1d8e42879a0737def9438932e6081765.mp4?t=1647211650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Complete a colourful selection of beautiful pixel art levels, each one filled with unique mechanics, fun puzzles and challenging platforming sections.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Level Is Your Playground</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919770/extras/a2579b6da644b4596ddfc1d855d704d1.poster.avif?t=1647211650\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919770/extras/a2579b6da644b4596ddfc1d855d704d1.webm?t=1647211650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919770/extras/a2579b6da644b4596ddfc1d855d704d1.mp4?t=1647211650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>No problem has only one solution. Use the wands given to you creatively to carve your path through the level or just mess around with objects and enemies - No matter how you use them, these tools will redefine your expectations.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Free Demo</h2><br>A free demo is now available! Play through the first zone of the game right now!! do it!!!",
